# Testing and release

- `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, and `npm run test` must pass.
- `npm run build` must pass before push or preview deploy.
- `git diff --check` must be clean.
- Check mobile and desktop layout, keyboard nav, and YouTube links in a browser when UI changed.
- Do not ship placeholder lorem, fake emails, or forms that discard submissions.
